WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:11.950
Stages & tags: your sales pipeline and its stages (say: enquiry, quote, payment, done) and the tags you put on customers.

2
00:00:12.498 --> 00:00:19.880
In "Pipelines & stages", see your trade's pipeline; add a stage with "New stage" and put them in order.

3
00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:26.300
If you sell in more than one way, create a "New pipeline" and set one with "Make default".

4
00:00:26.854 --> 00:00:32.730
Add tags in the tags section; they can then be used on customer records and in flows.

5
00:00:33.275 --> 00:00:39.300
Keep stages few (4 to 6); too many make moving customers tedious.
